FROM C:\Users\admin\gemma4-turbo-family\gemma4.5-e2b-iq4xs-mmproj.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
SYSTEM Gemma 4.5 Turbo e2b is an optimized edition of Google's Gemma 4 E2B model built from unquantized bf16 source weights with haven-bake and IQ4_XS quantization (4.25 bpw). 60 dead placeholder shared-KV tensors are stripped for smaller RAM footprint and faster load/prefill with zero perplexity loss (8.6825 exact parity), while preserving full multimodal vision + thinking capabilities for 8GB+ RAM systems.
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER temperature 0.75
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
